      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 9,
          "en": "So now with that little dive into pseudo classes and pseudo elements, let's dive into something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 14.7,
          "en": "Do you know these two rules? They're exactly equal if we leave out the selector which of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 15.6,
          "en": "differs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.99,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "If you got a case like this, you can group them into one rule because repeating code like this is not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 27.22,
          "en": "and if you ever change the color, you have to change it in two places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.24,
          "end": 33.51,
          "en": "So what we can do is we can group the two rules by adding a comma after the first one and then in the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.51,
          "end": 35.17,
          "en": "same one in the next line,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 40.29,
          "en": "I always add in the next line because it's easier to read, we add the next selector we want to add to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 40.29,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "the group and you can add as many as you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 44.85,
          "en": "Important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 44.85,
          "end": 50.17,
          "en": "this is not a combinator, these two rules, these two selectors are not related at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 50.28,
          "end": 52.92,
          "en": "they just share the same declaration set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 53.28,
          "end": 58.74,
          "en": "So now we can remove that active rule and still get the same effect because now it's simply grouped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 58.83,
          "end": 67.82,
          "en": "into one rule, into one assignment. So if we reload the page, we still got the hover and hold effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 67.93,
          "end": 69.59,
          "en": "So this still works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.59,
          "end": 72.47,
          "en": "it's now just in one group, in one rule.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
